WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:10.483
In tutorial 1.4, you'll describe
your business in your own words,

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.752
so every page and report
starts from real facts.

00:00:14.792 --> 00:00:18.512
First, say what you do in one or
two sentences: what you offer,

00:00:18.562 --> 00:00:19.964
and what makes you different.

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:28.037
Next, list what you sell, one item at a
time, then describe who your customers are.

00:00:31.746 --> 00:00:36.246
Then pick the main goal of your website.
It steers which keywords are chosen,

00:00:36.296 --> 00:00:37.918
and how each page ends.

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:44.121
Now choose your tone of voice and a call
to action, then add real business facts,

00:00:44.171 --> 00:00:46.847
like years in business or certifications.

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:51.232
Not sure what counts? Click
What makes a good fact?

00:00:51.282 --> 00:00:55.571
for a short guide. Pages quote your
facts, and never invent numbers.

00:00:56.575 --> 00:01:01.250
Then add up to three competitors, and the
full names people use for your company,

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.771
so AI answers about
you are read correctly.

00:01:05.075 --> 00:01:09.800
One check before you save. If your text
names places outside your main country,

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:14.700
like Riyadh and Jeddah for a business in
the Emirates, you'll see Check this first.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:18.675
Make that country your main one,
or tick Keep, then Continue.

00:01:18.725 --> 00:01:21.226
Or click Cancel, and change your text.

00:01:22.185 --> 00:01:25.660
When your details are right,
click Save and continue.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.702
The setup moves on to the
people behind your pages.

00:01:29.675 --> 00:01:35.450
Every page, report and question we ask AI
assistants now starts from your details.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.236
You can change them any
time in Website settings.

00:01:39.251 --> 00:01:43.001
So, say what you do, list what you
sell and who buys it, pick your goal,

00:01:43.051 --> 00:01:44.805
add real facts, and save.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:51.741
Your business is described. Next, choose
your first keyword in tutorial 1.5.
